        <div class="card-style-twelve B text-center mt-20 save-line">
        <span class="tag">3</span> 
            <h4>Transfer Your Domain</h4>
               <p>Choose, check availability, add to cart, and Transfer instantly!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <section class="section-gap mt-80">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-flash"></i> </div>
              <h4>High <span>Performance</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>By utilizing state-of-the-art processors, high-performance RAM, and NVMe SSDs, we ensure lightning-fast speed and instant responsiveness, keeping your projects running smoothly without interruption.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-support1"></i> </div>
              <h4>24/7 <span>Expert Support</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>Our dedicated support team is available 24/7 to help with any questions or issues, ensuring you have expert assistance whenever you need it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-server-2"></i> </div>
              <h4>Professional <span>Web Hosting</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>Our premium hosting solutions provide top-tier security, keeping your website safe and running smoothly with advanced DDoS protection.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-cloud-1"></i> </div>
              <h4>IP <span>Subnets</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>Expand Your Network with More IPv4/IPv6 Addresses. Seamlessly add extra IPs to scale your services and accommodate your growing demands.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-server-4"></i> </div>
              <h4>Multiple <span>Data Centers</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>Maximize performance and ensure consistent uptime with our globally positioned data centers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12">
          <div class="card-one">
            <div class="icon-width-heading">
              <div class="icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-cloud-2"></i> </div>
              <h4>Customised <span>Features</span></h4>
            </div>
            <p>Elevate your experience with advanced technology and exceptional support, crafted to surpass your expectations. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="feedback-section-nine position-relative z-1 pt-80 xl-pt-100 lg-pt-70 pb-130 lg-pb-80 ">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-70 lg-mb-30">
        <h2><span class="counter">12,0000</span>+</h2>
        <p class="fs-28  opacity-75">Customer love our product with more 20+ years reparation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="feedback-slider-six">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s reliable hosting and stellar support have been crucial for our startup’s growth.”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Sarah J.</span> Business Co-Founder</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s has boosted our site’s performance and reliability. Their support is excellent!”</blockquote>
